    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/000-Workspaces_And_Views/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 12,
      "text": "Today, workspace creation copies selected **bundled** view templates into `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`; the renderer dispatches built-in view IDs to React components. These are source-inspected development-checkout facts, not a runtime cert"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/002-View_Architecture/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 6,
      "text": "Today the server discovers numbered folders under `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`. Each folder's `manifest.md` declares a canonical, unique `metadata.view-id`; its `name` is the display label. The numeric folder prefix controls order, with fol"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/003-Adding_Workspaces/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 6,
      "text": "The Add Project modal warns that the folder must already contain `/ai`, then opens a folder picker. The client sends `workspace:add_requested` with `repoPath`; the WebSocket handler forwards the request to the server controller. The control"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/003-Adding_Workspaces/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 10,
      "text": "The Create New modal fetches a manifest and displays the included views. Its form accepts a project path and optional display name; the request sends those fields, not the displayed view IDs. The controller requires an absolute target with "
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/011-System_Manager/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 8,
      "text": "Editable instance folders are intended to move outside `System` into workspace `ai`; their exact path remains open. Today the server discovers capsules in `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`, and the bundled creation flow copies them there. This i"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/013-View_Activity_And_Collections/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 9,
      "text": "ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/state/state.json"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/013-View_Activity_And_Collections/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 133,
      "text": "Current per-view overrides are addressed through the registered capsule under `System/Views`; the approved target relocates editable instance resources outside `System` without changing the rule that platform state services own writes. Grou"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/000-Workspaces_And_Views/002-Decisions/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 15,
      "text": "The older proposed rule placing every installed view under `ai/<machine>/System/Views` is superseded as a **target**. That remains the observed current code path until the product changes. The older thin-instance interpretation is supersede"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/001-Workspaces_And_Views/022-View_Configuration_And_Agents/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 12,
      "text": "Today `views/index.js` discovers numbered capsules in `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`, reads their `manifest.md`, `content.json` and styles, and `panel-paths.js` resolves access through that registry. `view-state/resolver.js` locates each caps"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/002-Server_And_Runtime/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 46,
      "text": "- `fusion-studio-server/lib/views/index.js` is the V2 view resolver. It discovers `ai/<machine>/System/Views/NNN-view-id/` capsules, loads `manifest.md`, `content.json`, `styles/icon.md`, and `styles/layout.json`, and resolves declared cont"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/002-Server_And_Runtime/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 47,
      "text": "- `fusion-studio-server/lib/views/panel-paths.js` maps view panels only through the canonical `ai/<machine>/System/Views/` registry. The unrelated legacy System workspace/styles readers remain limited to their non-view compatibility surface"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/001-Code_Standards/003-State_Management/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 43,
      "text": "Fusion-owned view-state persistence currently uses the narrow view-state service while capsules live under `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`. The approved target relocates editable instances outside `System`; it does not change service ownership"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/001-Code_Standards/007-Persistence_And_Metadata/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 39,
      "text": "  `ai/<machine>/System/Views/`. The approved editable-instance target is outside"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 17,
      "text": "| Per-view layout CSS | `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/styles/layout.css` | One view |"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 18,
      "text": "| Per-view theme override | `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/styles/themes.css` | One view |"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 19,
      "text": "| Sidebar icon | `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/styles/icon.md` | One view |"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 20,
      "text": "| Per-view state override | `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/state/state.json` | One view |"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 39,
      "text": "Per-view CSS is fetched from the active view capsule under `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/styles/`. `layout.css` is for geometry and structure. `themes.css` is an optional manual override for one view. Icon selection comes from `s"
    },
    {
      "path": "ai/RC-MacAir-15/Wiki/005-Enforcement/002-Themes_And_State/PAGE.md",
      "body_line": 46,
      "text": "2. Load the view override from `ai/<machine>/System/Views/<view-folder>/state/state.json` when it exists."
    },
    {
